@startuml
!include theme.puml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF7FA
skinparam componentBorderColor #51768B
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
rectangle "현재 dev a480113" {
  component "Universe / Clock\n입력·세대 중재" as Universe
  component "캡처 편집\nPatternTools + BoardEditor" as Capture
  component "Cell 트리\n기존 셀의 나이·색" as Cells
  component "PropertyChange\nTEMPLATE / TEMPLATE_UNDO" as Signal
  Universe --> Capture : IF-01/03\nisEditing / boardChanged
  Capture --> Cells : IF-02\n변경 셀만 편집
  Capture --> Signal : IF-05\n완료 후 한 번
}
rectangle "미병합 PR의 연결" #FFF7E6 {
  component "PR #7 FreezingManager\nee1e763" as Freeze #FFF7E6
  component "PR #10 Universe\nBoardChangeEvent\n8eb1dfe" as Events #FFF7E6
  component "PR #10 통계·사운드 구독자" as Observers #FFF7E6
  Events ..> Observers : IF-05/06\n완료 스냅샷 / 종류 구분
}
Freeze ..> Capture : IF-04\nRectangle guard (true=차단)
Signal ..> Events : IF-05\nTEMPLATE / TEMPLATE_UNDO 구독
legend bottom
실선: 현재 dev 계약     점선: 미병합 PR의 조립 계약
PR #10 브랜치에는 이미 리스너가 있음. 병합 시 중복 등록 금지.
endlegend
@enduml
